Your example uses a function that has static parameter input. So every time apply calls 'sum', the 'na.rm' input remains the same. What I'm trying to figure out is how to make the parameter input change based on the input data. For instance, when the parameter is asking for a character string input and that string changes for every row. Perhaps a clarifying example would help:

