David, I think you want another function in the middle some_fancy_function <- function(parameter1, parameter2){ paste(parameter1, "is", parameter2, sep = " ") } some_fancy_linefunction <- function(lne) { some_fancy_function(lne["inventive"], lne["column_names"]) } call withapply(dummy_matrix, 1, some_fancy_linefunction) you're also going to want your matrix defined with byrow=TRUE or else you'll get this > apply(dummy_matrix, 1, some_fancy_linefunction) "coding is my brain" "hard, man is hurt"

